## Nodes
| Node | Type (agent/code/human) | Inputs | Outputs | Tools | Inner loop / limit |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| research | agent | task | requirements | read, search | until enough info, ≤ N |
| implement | agent | requirements, last error | code_ref | edit, run checks | ≤ 3 attempts |
| verify | agent (fresh context) | code_ref, spec | review pass/fail | read, run checks | 1 |
| approval | human | diff, evidence | approved | — | waits |
| merge | code | approved code_ref | done | git | 1 |

## Routing rules
| From | Condition | To |
|---|---|---|
| verify | review == pass | approval |
| verify | review == fail and attempts < 3 | implement |
| verify | missing information | research |
| verify | attempts ≥ 3 | escalate |

